    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Social</h3>\n<p><em>A skilled espionage agent, always in the right place.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Cut and run, disguise appearance, eavesdrop</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 13 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 5/9 | <strong>HP:</strong> 4 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> -2 | Weapon: Melee | 1d6+3 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Espionage +3</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Gathering Secrets - Action</strong>: Spend a Fear to describe how the Spy knows a secret about a PC in the scene.</p>\n<p><strong>Fly on the Wall - Reaction</strong>: When a PC or group is discussing something sensitive, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to reveal that the Spy had heard them. If the Spy escapes the scene, you gain 1d4 Fear.</p>\n",
